# Environment Configuration for LLM Integration

# ============================================
# OPTION 1: Azure OpenAI (Recommended)
# ============================================
# Use these environment variables for Azure OpenAI:

AZURE_OPENAI_API_KEY=your-azure-api-key-here
AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT=https://your-resource-name.openai.azure.com/
AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT_NAME=your-deployment-name
AZURE_OPENAI_API_VERSION=2024-02-15-preview

# ============================================
# OPTION 2: Standard OpenAI
# ============================================
# Use these environment variables for standard OpenAI:

# API_KEY=sk-your-openai-key-here
# BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1

# ============================================
# How to Find Azure OpenAI Values
# ============================================
# 1. API Key:
#    - Azure Portal → Your Azure OpenAI Resource
#    - Keys and Endpoint section → Copy Key 1
#
# 2. Endpoint:
#    - Azure Portal → Your Azure OpenAI Resource
#    - Keys and Endpoint section → Copy the Endpoint URL
#    - Format should be: https://resource-name.openai.azure.com/
#
# 3. Deployment Name:
#    - Azure Portal → Your Azure OpenAI Resource
#    - Model deployments section
#    - Copy the deployment name (e.g., "gpt-4", "gpt-4o-mini", etc.)
#
# 4. API Version:
#    - Default: 2024-02-15-preview (recommended)
#    - See Azure docs for other available versions
